# Part of sys-cut: A on the Route 204 North tree without the Forest Badge gives the "can be cut"
# message and no yes/no (advance text runs to idle); the tree stays.
party 0 platinum:SPECIES_BIBAREL 30 platinum:MOVE_CUT
warp platinum:MAP_HEADER_ROUTE_204_NORTH 181 679 up
until idle
+0 assert state objects[localId=8].z 678
+0 press a
+1 release a
until message
+0 assert message open
advance text
until idle
+0 assert flag platinum:FLAG_MAP_LOCAL_HIDE_OBSTACLE_1 false
+0 assert state objects[localId=8].z 678
